  "description": "Bonadan was a planet in the Corporate Sector and the primary world in the Bonadan system at the end of the Hydian Way, boasting ten large spaceports. The densely populated planet housed many exotic species from around the galaxy. Bonadanians found off-world were either from wealthy corporate families or those that had escaped the life of corporate servitude.",
